# Spike evidence stays ephemeral: captures are reproduced with
# `cd web && bun run shots`, not checked in. Scoped to docs/spikes so that
# genuine UI assets (favicons, OG images, docs diagrams) are NOT silently
# ignored -- the previous blanket `*.png` would have swallowed them.
docs/spikes/**/*.png
docs/spikes/**/*.jpg
docs/spikes/**/*.jpeg
docs/spikes/**/*.gif
docs/spikes/**/*.webp
docs/spikes/**/*.avif
docs/spikes/**/*.bmp
docs/spikes/**/*.tif
docs/spikes/**/*.tiff
docs/spikes/**/*.mp4
docs/spikes/**/*.mov
docs/spikes/**/*.webm
/spikes/artifacts
/spikes/**/target
